      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today we are shipping intelligent routing for local models into experimental preview.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GitHub Copilot Fusion can now choose between supported on-device models and cloud models, enabling intelligent local model routing in GitHub Copilot CLI, GitHub Copilot app, and Visual Studio Code.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Once the model is ready, select Standard in Copilot Fusion to let Copilot choose between local and cloud models.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The managed download experience is Windows-only, but Copilot CLI&rsquo;s local Copilot Fusion routing also works with manually configured models on Windows, macOS, and Linux.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can configure MAI Code 1.1 Flash or Qwen3.8 Flash Next through a local OpenAI-compatible server.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Configure the model as a supported local-model provider, enable experimental local routing, and select Standard in Copilot Fusion to let Copilot choose between eligible local and cloud models.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Copilot app also supports connecting and directly selecting compatible local models through BYOK.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Copilot Fusion still makes routing decisions in the cloud, and local models may have different safety protections from Copilot-provided cloud models.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For setup instructions, see Adding LLM models to GitHub Copilot CLI and Adding LLM models to the GitHub Copilot app .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:42.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T16:37:21.459Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Route and orchestrate models with GitHub Copilot Fusion",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-fusion-now-supports-selection-of-local-models",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
